# Build context = repository root. Keep the image vendor-neutral and small.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/build
**/out
.alelt
.git
.github
console/dist
console/test-results
console/playwright-report
extensions
exchange
prompts
docs
runbooks
edge-agent
dist
reviews
lab
# secrets never enter the build context (DEP-27): every .env / secrets dir / key or cert file, wherever it lives
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p8
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.crt
**/*.jks
# test harnesses never ship in the product image (DEP-27): only the ladder evidence files the console shows
tests/**
!tests/golden
!tests/golden/**
!tests/ladder
!tests/ladder/*/
!tests/ladder/*/result*.json
